From f774118a8223052f7d0d7ca82c8a1b9b41f12afb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ayoub Zaki <ayoub.zaki@embetrix.com>
Date: Fri, 16 Jan 2026 11:03:24 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] Make Spectrum/electrum client tolerant to electrs
 indexing

- Buffer and parse recv_loop safely exit on peer close
- Harden ping loop against unexpected errors
- Treat 'unavailable index' as transient and avoid startup abort
- Add regression test for recv_loop close-without-newline

Signed-off-by: Ayoub Zaki <ayoub.zaki@embetrix.com>
---
 src/cryptoadvance/spectrum/elsock.py   | 96 ++++++++++++++++++--------
 src/cryptoadvance/spectrum/spectrum.py | 33 +++++----
 tests/test_elsock.py                   | 28 ++++++++
 3 files changed, 115 insertions(+), 42 deletions(-)

